From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sunu Aziz Rahayu <sunuazizrahayu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] build: allow generic_arm64 to copy ELF prebuilts

Treble menyalin binary ELF prebuilt (busybox_phh, dbclient, getSPL)
lewat PRODUCT_COPY_FILES, yang di Android 16 menjadi error:

  found ELF prebuilt in PRODUCT_COPY_FILES, use cc_prebuilt_binary /
  cc_prebuilt_library_shared instead

Longgarkan pemeriksaan itu untuk target generic GSI. (Port dari
MisterZtr.)
---
 target/board/generic_arm64/BoardConfig.mk | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/target/board/generic_arm64/BoardConfig.mk b/target/board/generic_arm64/BoardConfig.mk
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/target/board/generic_arm64/BoardConfig.mk
+++ b/target/board/generic_arm64/BoardConfig.mk
@@ -65,3 +65,5 @@ include build/make/target/board/BoardConfigGsiCommon.mk
 # TODO(b/36764215): remove this setting when the generic system image
 # no longer has QCOM-specific directories under /.
 BOARD_SEPOLICY_DIRS += build/make/target/board/generic_arm64/sepolicy
+
+BUILD_BROKEN_ELF_PREBUILT_PRODUCT_COPY_FILES := true
--
2.54.0
